["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"From AGENTS.md to Enterprise Deployment Agents.md buildpack MCP gateway air gap 12 factor application\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-practicalai-企业里跑-ai-智能体-先解决它半夜会不会掉线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5fdd0bb6d017658d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">48:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Practical AI</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>企业里跑 AI 智能体，先解决它半夜会不会掉线</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">企业智能体不是新物种，是又一个要过合规、要审计、要能被平台统一托管的 app；真正的难点是状态、身份和网络位置。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业部署</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Stress: The Science of Chilling Out vagus nerve cortisol threat response challenge response vagus nerve stimulator\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-sciencevs-从没受过什么苦的人-心理健康反而比吃过苦的人差/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">40:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>从没受过什么苦的人，心理健康反而比吃过苦的人差</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">布法罗大学的研究发现，一辈子零逆境的人心理健康得分比经历过一些逆境的人更差——压力反应本身需要被练出来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">压力管理</span><span class=\"tag\">皮质醇</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI Is Upending the Lives of People Who Do Social Media Professionally carousel reel slop BTS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-oddlots-ai-时代做社媒-老板比算法更让人绝望/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">27:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI 时代做社媒，老板比算法更让人绝望</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">营销团队真正的 AI 冲击来自老板：把直觉外包给 Claude，只批 Copilot 生成的方案，员工只好把想法伪装成 Copilot 界面骗过审批。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">创作者经济</span><span class=\"tag\">社媒营销</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Advice Line with Danny Meyer of Shake Shack expected behaviors day one mentality RTD Goldbelly GLP-1\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-howibuilt-餐厅老板给三个食品创业者的建议-比融资课有用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aedd4aae43a50f3c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">41:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">How I Built This</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>餐厅老板给三个食品创业者的建议，比融资课有用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Danny Meyer 判断品牌的标准不是产品好不好，而是顾客见不到你时还能不能感到被照顾——这决定了他给三个消费品牌的建议方向。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">餐饮</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Case Against an AI Pause | Eddy Lazzarin P-abundance P-doom agent swarm agent fleets mech interpretability script kitties\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-a16z-ai-暂停论站不住脚-我们该算的是延迟的代价/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">27:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI 暂停论站不住脚：我们该算的是延迟的代价</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把 AI 事故当成网络安全和控制失败，而不是超级智能的预兆；真正被忽略的不是末日概率，而是延迟进步让人类放弃的东西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">监管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"How to Invest for A Hundred Years | Inigo Fraser Jenkins total portfolio approach rule against perpetuities recency bias 60-40\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-hiddenforces-股票和债券的风险其实一样大-只是没人告诉你/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b4203c8f6331570-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">52:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Forces</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>股票和债券的风险其实一样大，只是没人告诉你</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把持有期拉长到20年，股票和债券的波动率几乎相等，债券出现实际亏损的概率反而更高——所以长期投资者真正该盯的不是市场基准，是购买力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">资产配置</span><span class=\"tag\">长期投资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Democratic Socialism. Hope or Hopeless? DSA Rerum Novarum War on Poverty realignment left wing of the possible\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-throughline-美国-社会主义教父-的选择-向民主党内部妥协-而非揭竿另立/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">50:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>美国「社会主义教父」的选择：向民主党内部妥协，而非揭竿另立</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Harrington押注：与其在体制外另立社会主义政党，不如挤进民主党内部改造它——哪怕这意味着1968年要为支持越战的候选人站台。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国政治</span><span class=\"tag\">民主党</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Energy From Orbit: Can We Trust Power Beamed From Space? - Martin Soltau, Space Solar (EP 42) firm power rectenna power beaming intermittency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-theinbetweente-把发电站搬到太空-电价能降一个数量级吗/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1b62c3494802d4ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">31:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The In-Between Tech and Trust Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>把发电站搬到太空，电价能降一个数量级吗</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">太空太阳能不是科幻：同样的光伏板在轨道上发电量是地面的 8 到 13 倍，真正的瓶颈不是物理，而是监管和公众信任。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">太空太阳能</span><span class=\"tag\">能源转型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"277.从提醒你，到替你办：Today想把Personal AI带到哪一步？ Personal Agent harness proactive KVCache rubrics\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-luanfanshu-个人-agent-的胜负手不是模型-是记忆和主动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bbe378ca5d7d3313-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"乱\"><span class=\"dur\">1:39:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">乱翻书</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>个人 Agent 的胜负手不是模型，是记忆和主动</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Today 团队认为模型已接近 AGI、成本每年降十倍，瓶颈转移到记忆与主动性；而主动做不好的产品，只会变成又一个骚扰推送。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Personal Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">记忆系统</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Maya Hieroglyphs Decoded Classic Mayan uhul ahau Ahpitz\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-ancients-玛雅数学家的公式写在王宫旁的墙上-只给自己看/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/863dd630b8114639-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>玛雅数学家的公式写在王宫旁的墙上，只给自己看</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2010年危地马拉舒尔顿意外发掘出一间小屋，墙上写满历法计算公式并署名萨克坦瓦什——这不是刻给公众看的纪念碑文，而是一位玛雅数学家留给自己查阅的私人笔记。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">玛雅</span><span class=\"tag\">古文字破译</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"1M Users in 3 Months, Pivoted, Then Tripled User Count | James Clift, Durable GEO GMV South Park Commons vibe coding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-solofounders-ai-让开公司比找工作容易-但单人创始人没有退路/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3187025de0dd83a2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">单人创始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI 让开公司比找工作容易，但单人创始人没有退路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Durable 三个月做到一百万用户，创始人却说自己绕了弯路：网站生成不是终局，把服务业的全部后台交给 AI 才是。单人创始人不是更自由，是把所有决定都压在自己身上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">单人创始人</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The &#x27;Scandalous&#x27; Life of Marie Antoinette Petit Hameau Salic law Estates General flight to Varennes\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-historyhit-法国国王没有情妇-于是所有的恨都砸向王后/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8da68a5c17656ef9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">53:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>法国国王没有情妇，于是所有的恨都砸向王后</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">君主是神选的，攻击国王等于叛国，能骂的只有王后和情妇。路易十六偏偏不像历代法王那样有情妇，怨恨没有分流口，全落在玛丽·安托瓦内特一个人身上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法国大革命</span><span class=\"tag\">王权</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Luca Ferrari, Bending Spoons CEO: The $40K Origin Story, Buying Product-Market Fit &amp; Why Private Equity Can&#x27;t Compete TLB (Term Loan B) unlevered returns\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-allin-私募股权学不会这套打法-团队和技术焊死后就没法转卖/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/699f18b66a57c00f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">25:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>私募股权学不会这套打法：团队和技术焊死后就没法转卖</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">创始人光环不是必需品：Bending Spoons靠统一技术底座和小团队把收购来的产品跑到10分，这套打法PE学不来，因为PE要把公司分开养肥了卖，不敢把团队和技术打通。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">并购</span><span class=\"tag\">私募股权</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Vol.276 做月嫂育儿嫂的姐姐，都有故事 chemistry 飞单 预约单和急单 儿童成长陪伴师\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-bizthisway-好阿姨永远在户上-家政顾问卖的不是信息/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6fd1ebf29b7a3afa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"商\"><span class=\"dur\">1:53:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">商业就是这样</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>好阿姨永远在户上，家政顾问卖的不是信息</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">家政是供给主导的行业，好阿姨不流入市场，顾问真正难的不是签单而是售后换人；雇主和阿姨都是工资的搬运工。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">家政</span><span class=\"tag\">月嫂育儿嫂</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"E911.万人工厂消失后，他的 200 万张照片成了时代档案 卖猪仔 自我民族志 马格兰 Off-Pix\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-cn907a40-万人工厂消失后-他用-20-年拍下打工者的日常/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec61bd9ea105317f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"故\"><span class=\"dur\">43:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">故事FM</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>万人工厂消失后，他用 20 年拍下打工者的日常</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">别人拍时代的异常，他偏拍时代的日常——吃饭、打卡、学英语。等万人大厂真的消失，只有极少数人留下了这套档案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">制造业</span><span class=\"tag\">纪实摄影</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"VCs Would Bet on Open-Source AI Over OpenAI and Anthropic | E2341 Unreasonable Hospitality Dream Weaver table stakes minute of grace\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-twist-把服务当成本中心的公司-正在把护城河让出去/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/94d63a8348494027-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Startups</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>把服务当成本中心的公司，正在把护城河让出去</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">产品会被更好的产品取代，品牌会被更强的品牌取代，唯一长期存在的竞争优势是待客之道——持续而慷慨地投资于关系。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">待客之道</span><span class=\"tag\">组织管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"An Exclusive Interview With Ukraine’s President Zelensky PAC-2 PAC-3 Shahed drones\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-wsjournal-泽连斯基-中东战争正在抽走乌克兰的防空导弹/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fc66680f65b8e859-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">25:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Journal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>泽连斯基：中东战争正在抽走乌克兰的防空导弹</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国每月只造 60 到 65 枚导弹，中东开战第一天就打掉 803 枚。泽连斯基说，普京要的就是一场长战争，因为资源耗尽对乌克兰不利。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">俄乌战争</span><span class=\"tag\">中东局势</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At The Money: Who Is Wealthy in America, and How Did They Get Rich? pass-through business Survey of Consumer Finances C corporation TCJA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-mastersinbiz-美国最富的一群人-不是ceo而是开洗车店和暖通公司的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3553c0305688ae6b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">25:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>美国最富的一群人，不是CEO而是开洗车店和暖通公司的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国300万私人企业主净资产超500万美元，合计财富是福布斯400富豪的十倍以上——他们开洗车店、暖通公司、汽车经销店，靠的是拥有而不是挣工资。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">财富分布</span><span class=\"tag\">创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"How Deep Learning Finally Cracked Messy Tables - Frank Hutter in-context learning posterior predictive distribution do-calculus structural causal model ELO score\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-mlst-深度学习靠合成数据训练-终于打赢了表格数据里的xgboost/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/166bfadd1a24fa05-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:53:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ML Street Talk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>深度学习靠合成数据训练，终于打赢了表格数据里的XGBoost</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">能找到的真实表格数据集只有约5万个，不足以喂饱深度网络；PriorLabs转而用因果结构模型批量合成训练数据，让TabPFN第一次在表格预测上稳定超过XGBoost和CatBoost。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">表格数据</span><span class=\"tag\">基础模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"🔬Bio-security is an AI Arms Race - Eric Nguyen (CEO, Radical Numerics) GLM (Genome Language Model) HyenaDNA Evo Omni biodefense sequence matching\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-latentspace-ai-能造出病毒了-防御方还停在序列比对/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1e6493311dc717df-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>AI 能造出病毒了，防御方还停在序列比对</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">生成致病序列的模型和判别序列是否致病的模型本质上是同一批模型，所以做设计的团队最适合做防御——但防御侧现在远远落后，基线还停在序列比对。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生物安全</span><span class=\"tag\">基因组模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Robert Moses and the Shaping of New York, Part 2 Title I slum clearance Power Broker King Features Syndicate\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-stuffmissed-他修的路拆了谁的房-罗伯特-摩西的纽约遗产/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">42:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>他修的路拆了谁的房：罗伯特·摩西的纽约遗产</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">摩西用联邦 Title I 资金拆掉26个街区，把穷人从贫民窟赶到另一个贫民窟，却宣称98%的搬迁者住得更好——他的遗产至今无人能定论。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">城市更新</span><span class=\"tag\">基础设施</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Auto Research on Yukon with Soubhik Deb Q-day Johnson bound proximity gap NSD ping-pong MLX Dark Bloom\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-zeroknowledge-google-藏起来的量子方案-被一群业余研究者反超了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7dca63fe71cd70d3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Z\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Zero Knowledge</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>Google 藏起来的量子方案，被一群业余研究者反超了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Google 用零知识证明证明自己找到了更省资源的量子破解方案，却不公开电路。Yukon 把这个问题变成开放竞赛，让 agent 在别人的提交上继续跑，最终反超 Google 结果 60% 以上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动研究</span><span class=\"tag\">零知识证明</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"What Lyse Doucet Has Learned from 40 Years Reporting From War Zones, Live war of choice chadili agency madrasa\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-iq2-信息从未如此充裕-我们却选择不知道/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/30946a55a23131db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Intelligence Squared</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>信息从未如此充裕，我们却选择不知道</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Lyse Doucet 做了四十年战地报道，她的判断是：不知道不是因为信息不够，而是因为不想知道。而这场伊朗战争是一场选择之战，它让一切变得更糟。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">战地报道</span><span class=\"tag\">伊朗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Shashank Joshi on Why Russia Won&#x27;t Invade NATO—Yet Article V hybrid warfare Bab-el-Mandeb East-West pipeline\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-goodfight-俄罗斯不会入侵北约-但正在测试它会不会散架/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>俄罗斯不会入侵北约，但正在测试它会不会散架</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">俄罗斯没有能力发动地面进攻，它的真正目标是腐蚀北约的政治凝聚力——用无人机、包裹炸弹和模糊地带，逼美国在危机中暴露分歧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地缘政治</span><span class=\"tag\">北约</span>\n</div></div></a>"]